  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">DEMOCRACY UPGRADED  (CSO-STRATEGIN 2025-2029)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Democracy Upgraded 2026-2028 (CSO strategy)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Democracy Upgraded (DU) is a non-profit organization that promotes democratic participation and works to include groups at risk of being excluded from decision-making processes. The organization operates internationally and is planning a project in Colombia to strengthen deliberative democracy&#x2014;dialogue and joint consideration between citizens and decision-makers before decisions are made.
The project will be carried out in collaboration with Con Tacto Local, a Colombian civil society organization with experience in participatory democracy and inclusive work with youth, women, Indigenous peoples, and social leaders.
Goal: To strengthen local capacity among civil society actors in Buenaventura and surrounding areas through training in the theory and methods of deliberative democracy. Buenaventura was chosen as the location because it is a regional hub, making it easier for participants from neighboring areas to attend.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Democracy Upgraded (DU) &#xe4;r en ideell organisation som fr&#xe4;mjar demokratiskt deltagande och arbetar f&#xf6;r att inkludera grupper som riskerar att uteslutas fr&#xe5;n beslutsprocesser. Organisationen verkar internationellt och planerar ett projekt i Colombia f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka deliberativ demokrati &#x2013; dialog och gemensamt &#xf6;verv&#xe4;gande mellan medborgare och beslutsfattare innan beslut fattas.
Projektet genomf&#xf6;rs i samarbete med Con Tacto Local, en colombiansk civilsamh&#xe4;llesorganisation med erfarenhet av deltagande demokrati och inkluderande arbete f&#xf6;r ungdomar, kvinnor, urfolk och sociala ledare.
M&#xe5;l: St&#xe4;rka lokal kapacitet hos civilsamh&#xe4;llesakt&#xf6;rer i Buenaventura och n&#xe4;rliggande omr&#xe5;den genom utbildningar i teori och metoder f&#xf6;r deliberativ demokrati. Buenaventura valdes som plats eftersom det &#xe4;r en regional knutpunkt som underl&#xe4;ttar deltagande fr&#xe5;n angr&#xe4;nsande omr&#xe5;den.</narrative>
  </description>
